      "id": "claim_a5c4fa3891d944d7b5fcaedbdc3e4ce5",
      "statement": "Deep Agents summarization preserves raw `messages` and records an effective-history `_summarization_event`; it persists history before summary generation on the synchronous path, runs those independent operations concurrently on the asynchronous path, and continues with `file_path=None` when history offload fails.",
