      "statement": "Deep Agents installs `ModelRefusalMiddleware` after its main-stack fallback opportunity by default, so a main-agent refusal raises `ModelRefusalError`; an earlier fallback can handle it and a harness profile can exclude the middleware to retain the provider refusal message.",
