      "id": "claim_fa71db7ec1aa4bc094494171212153b4",
      "statement": "The server-side offload API is a replay-based operation keyed by thread ID and stable `operation_id`: hook interrupts return without retaining a suspended coroutine, and a later request re-executes the operation using accumulated hook responses.",
