      "statement": "dcode graph cost is durable checkpoint state: a process-wide recorder captures completed model requests, `CostTrackingMiddleware` prices and drains them on graph checkpoint paths without double-charging already-recorded main responses, and nested graphs transfer completed private deltas to their parent through owner-scoped state.",
