      "statement": "In Talon attended conversations, `task` and `start_async_task` detach process-local, owner-scoped jobs subject to a shared running-worker limit; workers clear authorization handling, use independent thread IDs, and convert timeout, ordinary failure, and approval interrupts into safe result text.",
